["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">辛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>辛辣；痛苦；艰苦；难受；严酷</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">から.い・つら.い・-づら.い・かのと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辛い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">からい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">辛辣；麻辣；咸；有盐味；尖刻；严厉；严苛；痛苦；苦涩；艰难；难熬</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">塩辛い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しおからい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">咸的；有盐味的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辛抱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">耐心；忍耐；坚持</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">磨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>研磨；磨光；擦洗；改善；刷牙</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みが.く・す.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">磨く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みがく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抛光；擦亮；磨光；磨；清洁；刷（牙）；磨制（镜片等）；磨练；提高；精进；完善；培养</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">歯磨き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はみがき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刷牙；牙齿清洁；牙膏；牙粉；洁齿剂</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">麦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>大麦；小麦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むぎ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">小麦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こむぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">小麦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">蕎麦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">荞麦；荞麦面；日式荞麦面条；中式小麦面条；中华面</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">姓</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>姓氏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">姓</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">姓氏；（古代日本）世袭姓号；表示氏族等级与政治地位的称号</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">姓名</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいめい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">姓名；全名</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">筒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>筒状物；管子；枪管；炮管；套筒</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">封筒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふうとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">信封</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">水筒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">水壶；水瓶；保温瓶</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">筒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">管；筒；圆筒；枪管；炮管；枪；炮；井壁；井圈</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鼻</div><div class=\"k-bo