">名词</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">胃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>胃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">胃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">い</span><span class=\"k-wz\">胃；胃部；胃宿（二十八宿之一）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">畳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>叠；榻榻米；折叠；关闭；废除</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョウ・チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たた.む・たたみ・かさ.なる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">畳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（计量单位）叠；张（用于计算榻榻米数量，每张约1.82或1.54平方米）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">畳む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たたむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">折叠（衣服、雨伞等）；关闭；歇业（店铺、生意）；腾空；搬离</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">机</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>桌子；书桌</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つくえ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">机</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つくえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">桌子；书桌；办公桌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\