\"ja\">貝殻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいがら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贝壳；贝类外壳</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">符</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>记号；凭证；票券；音符；护符</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">切符</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きっぷ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">票；券；票券</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">符号</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふごう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">符号；标记；记号；代码；符号（如正负号）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">憎</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>憎恨；可恶；可憎；憎恶</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゾウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">にく.む・にく.い・にく.らしい・にく.しみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">憎い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にくい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">可恨的；讨厌的；令人厌恶的；令人恼火的；令人气恼的；了不起的；极好的；令人钦佩的；可爱的；美妙的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">憎む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にくむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">憎恨；厌恶；痛恨</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">憎らしい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にくらしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">令人厌恶的；可憎的；讨厌的；可恨的；（反语）讨人喜欢的；可爱的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">皿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>盘子；碟子；一盘（的量）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ベイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お皿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おさら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">盘子；碟子</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">灰皿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいざら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">烟灰缸；烟灰盘</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">皿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">盘子；碟子；盘；碟；一份；一道菜；一道；皿部首（位于字底）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">肯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>同意；应允；顺从</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">がえんじ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">肯定</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">肯定；确认；肯定式；肯定形</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">燥</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>干燥；焦躁；欢闹</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はしゃ.ぐ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾燥</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">干燥；干旱；烘干；脱水；干燥处理；枯燥乏味；无趣味</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">畜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>家畜；牲畜</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">牧畜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼくちく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">畜牧；家畜饲养；牲畜养殖</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">家畜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かちく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">家畜；牲畜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">畜産</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちくさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">畜牧业；畜产业</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">瓦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>瓦片；克（重量单位）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かわら・ぐらむ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">瓦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かわら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">瓦片；屋顶瓦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">煉瓦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れんが</span><span class=\"k-wz\">砖；砖块</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">挟</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>夹住；夹在中间；挟带</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はさ.む・はさ.まる・わきばさ.む・さしはさ.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">挟む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はさむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">夹住；握住；用（手指、筷子等）夹；夹在；夹进；插入；穿插；夹；捏；卡（如手指被门夹）；困住；插入；穿插；打断；插嘴；加入（如笑话）；隔着（道路、桌子等）相对；分处两侧；隔（街、河）相望；心怀；抱有（感情）；投以（如怀疑）；（围棋）夹；夹击（对方棋子）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">挟まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はさまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">被夹住；卡住；陷入其中</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">曇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>阴天；转阴；蒙上雾气</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くも.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">曇り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くもり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阴云；多云天气；雾气；模糊；朦胧；阴影；暗淡；阴郁；沮丧</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">曇る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くもる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">天空阴云；乌云密布；天气转阴；蒙上雾气；起雾；变得模糊；表情阴沉；神情黯淡；面容忧郁；（能剧面具）微微向下倾斜（表示悲伤、哀痛等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">滴</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>滴；水滴；滴落</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しずく・したた.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">水滴</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいてき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">水滴；水滴盂；砚滴</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">爪</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>爪；指甲；趾甲</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つめ・つま-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">爪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">指甲；爪；趾甲；蹄；拨片；琴拨；钩；扣环</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">枕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>枕头</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チン・シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まくら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">枕</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まくら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">枕；枕头；引子；开场白</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">丼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>大碗；碗装食物</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トン・タン・ショウ・セイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">どんぶり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">丼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どんぶり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">瓷碗；大瓷碗；盖饭；丼饭；（日式）腹兜前面的口袋</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">斬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>砍断；斩杀；新颖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザン・サン・セン・ゼン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">き.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">斬る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">用刀刃（刀、砍刀、小刀等）杀死（人）；切断；砍掉；割掉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">餅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>年糕；饼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘイ・ヒョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もち・もちい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">餅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">糯米团子；年糕</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">芯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>灯芯；铅笔芯；果芯；芯材；订书钉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">芯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灯芯；骨髓；订书钉；铅笔芯；填充物；芯材；（植物的）髓；核心；中心；雌蕊；雄蕊</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">伺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>拜访；询问；窥视；探听；问候</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うかが.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>"]